* `\Nhanes\questionnaire\smoking behavior\# days smoked cigs during past 30 days\` (continuous)  

There are dozens of additional smoking‑related items (e.g., pipe and cigar use) that you can explore.

**Alcohol use** – several NHANES questionnaire variables capture alcohol consumption, such as:  

* `\Nhanes\questionnaire\alcohol use\days drink in year\` (continuous)  
* `\Nhanes\questionnaire\alcohol use\drink per day\` (continuous)  
* `\Nhanes\questionnaire\alcohol use\drink 5 in a day\` (categorical – Yes/No)  
